<h2>3 · Predict 🔮</h2>
<p>Read each block. Write what happens — just from reading.</p>
<pre><code class="language-python">bullet = [197, 300]
bullet_speed = 12

bullet[1] = bullet[1] - bullet_speed
print(bullet)
</code></pre>
<p class="mini-q">Step 1 — Which slot changed, and what does that slot mean?</p>

