bullet_lastshot = 0
now = 250

print(now - bullet_lastshot &gt; bullet_cooldown)
</code></pre>
<p class="mini-q">Step 1 — Work out the left side of the `>` first.</p>

<p class="ruled">&nbsp;</p><p class="ruled">&nbsp;</p><p class="ruled">&nbsp;</p>

